// tools/design_autopilot.py from THIS vehicle's aero + mass). Demonstrates the
// Lego control block: components (aero/motor) are identical -- only the
// gnc.control_law changed, and its gains were auto-generated rather than
// hand-tuned.
{
  "mass_kg": 59.5,
  "inertia": { "ixx": 1.755, "iyy": 479.7, "izz": 479.7 },

  "components": [
